  "approved_schema": [
    "One actual DecoratorCollision semantic value contains owned Triangle Vec, same Arc<RaycastMeshData> and Rectangle3d. Clone copies actual triangles and shares Arc; not Copy/bbox surrogate.64B offsets are evidence, no repr/nativepointercasting.",
    "Unique four actual maps store collision/interaction values plus actual distinct Outline and CollisionOutline enums. Present explicitNone is a value; absent required exact key panics. No secondlegacygeometry registry or emptyasset success.",
    "Outline Mesh(String)/Lines(Vec<Vec3>)/Sphere(f32)/None and separate CollisionOutline Lines/Sphere/None follow original transfers/drop/reader. Schema only; display/factory/animation not approved here.",
    "Borrowed collision_record/interaction_record and required get_outline/get_collision_outline return same storedobjects without perdecorator clones. Adapter name is currenthost API, not recovered author spelling.",
    "Subtype/rank logical key order is explicit; same Resources/View owners retained. Legacy record cannot supply fake canonical collision after migration."
  ],
  "ordering_requirements": [
    "Shared insert clones triangles+Arc before firstinsert, inserts clonecollision→originalinteraction→outline→collisionoutline, dropping each replaced value immediately after corresponding insertion. No rollback/atomicreplace.",
